   "text": "Pick: D's mechanics (zoomable field, shuffle, trail, Surprise) wearing A's editorial restraint (strict grid, big type, one accent).\n\nB is fun but noisy at 100 buildings. C is beautiful but slow: one building at a time kills the 'one more' loop.",
