  "s_system": {
   "fill": "gray",
   "text": "Three rules:\n1. Architecture is the only colour. The UI stays black, white and grey, with one signal blue for things that move you somewhere new.\n2. Every surface is a door. Tiles, chips and concepts all click through.\n3. Remember the path. The trail turns browsing into a story you can retrace.",
